1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Post a measurable model bug. Let workers compete.
Verify fixes on held-out evaluation. Settle the winner.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Recorded local proof, not customer data and not a live payment.
The frozen parent starts at 84.72%.

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Three real worker processes submitted low-rank model updates.
One is a disclosed shuffled-label negative control.

4
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Bounty rules are frozen before evaluation.
Public progress and hidden verification stay separate.

5
00:01:35,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The selected fix reaches 95.28%:
a 10.56 percentage-point improvement over 360 held-out examples.

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:20,000
The current task format accepts bounded model data,
not arbitrary worker executable code.

7
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:38,000
The Fix Passport links the parent, accepted model,
worker, evaluator, policy and measured improvement.

8
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:50,000
This run is local and correctly claims no finalized payout.
Missing evidence never becomes a success claim.
